			"Message": "chore(Project): Advance 9 Element submodules with dependency bumps and SideCar Node version update\n\nAdvance nine Land/Element submodules in a coordinated update spanning dependabot-managed version bumps and a SideCar runtime version upgrade.\n\n**Dependency bumps (5 submodules):**\n- Common: @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260520.1→4.20260521.1\n- Echo: miniflare 4.20260518.0→4.20260520.0, wrangler 4.93.0→4.93.1\n- Output: semver 7.8.0→7.8.1\n- Sky: astro 6.3.5→6.3.7, vite 8.0.13→8.0.14, @astrojs/compiler-rs 0.2.0→0.2.1\n- Wind: @effect/language-service 0.86.1→0.86.2\n\n**Runtime update (1 submodule):**\n- SideCar: Node.js version bumped to v24.16.0 for both aarch64 and x86_64 platforms\n\n**Merge commits only (3 submodules):**\n- Cocoon, Rest, Worker: Advance to tip with no semantic changes\n\nZero runtime behaviour changes across all submodules — all bumps are semver-compatible patches.",
