			"Message": "chore(Project): Advance all 10 Element submodules with dependency bumps, style normalisation, and dead-code cleanup\n\nAdvance every Land/Element submodule in a coordinated update spanning dependabot-managed version bumps, formatting corrections across ESBuild configurations, and removal of unused imports and variables.\n\n**Dependency bumps (6 submodules):**\n- Cocoon: @grpc/grpc-js 1.14.3→1.14.4, vitest 4.1.6→4.1.7, @effect/language-service 0.86.1→0.86.2\n- Common: @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260519.1→4.20260520.1\n- Echo: @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260519.1→4.20260520.1 then →4.20260521.1\n- Output: mocha 11.7.5→11.7.6\n- Sky: astro 6.3.5→6.3.6→6.3.7, @astrojs/compiler-rs 0.2.0→0.2.1, vite 8.0.13→8.0.14, @xterm/xterm 6.1.0-beta.219→220\n- Wind: catalog date regeneration\n\n**Style normalisation (4 submodules):**\n- Cocoon: Convert config JS from tabs to 2-space, strip trailing commas, normalise import ordering and export blocks\n- Output: Hoist __defProp/__name shims before imports, convert compiled artifacts to 2-space indent, collapse multi-line expressions\n- Wind: Revert ESBuild config tabs→2-space, reorganise imports, multi-line exports\n- Worker: Revert ESBuild config tabs→2-space, inline helpers, multi-line exports\n\n**Dead-code removal (3 submodules):**\n- Air: Remove unused imports from Configuration and Resilience modules\n- Mountain: Remove unused HandleSlot variable in GetOrInitChannel\n- Sky: Remove unused dependencies from package.json\n\nZero runtime behaviour changes across all submodules — build outputs are semantically identical.",
			"SHA": "076bf6f0718babdb825e7f3bb3f7988c45aa49cf"
		},
